<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>04 / 套路层面</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>两条推荐路线如何共同工作</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={190} viewBox='0 0 1140 190'><rect x='0' y='40' width='151' height='88' rx='8' fill='#0E2340' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='75.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>套路顺序与前置关系</text><text x='75.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>默认路径</text><line x1='157' y1='84' x2='183' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M183 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='197' y='40' width='151' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='272.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>形成候选套路</text><text x='272.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>结合准备情况</text><line x1='354' y1='84' x2='380' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M380 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='394' y='40' width='151' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='469.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>知识点 + 套路表现 + 到期复查</text><text x='469.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>四项输入</text><line x1='551' y1='84' x2='577' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M577 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='591' y='40' width='151' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='666.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>推荐新套路 / 补知识 / 练步骤 / 做复查</text><text x='666.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>给出理由</text><line x1='748' y1='84' x2='774' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M774 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='788' y='40' width='151' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='863.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>六步循环或补充任务</text><text x='863.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>执行</text><line x1='945' y1='84' x2='971' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M971 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='985' y='40' width='151' height='88' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='1060.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>新的独立作答证据</text><text x='1060.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>更新后续推荐</text></svg><svg width={1140} height={110} viewBox='0 0 1140 110'><rect x='0' y='10' width='1140' height='90' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='570' y='42' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>每次推荐应给出简明理由，例如“相关知识已有独立作答证据，但这个套路的变式尚未通过”</text><text x='570' y='76' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>不是永远挑正确率最高的题，也不是一味选最薄弱最难的内容；缺少记录 ≠ 不会</text></svg></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：套路层面设计思路.md §4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 42 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>